VIEWGIF 2.0 for the Psion Series 3a                                  12/03/94
===================================                                  ========

Introduction
------------

Viewgif 1.1 was originally released in January 1993 for the S3. This
version will only run on a Series 3a, those of you that own
256K machines may find this a little hard to do - Viewgif 2 requires at
least 78K of free memory just to start up!

Viewgif 2.0 makes full use of the grey plane and therefore image quality is
vastly improved.


Installation
------------

Only one file is required to run Viewgif and that is VIEWGIF.OPA
Copy this file into the \APP directory and install this using the INSTALL
APPLICATION option.


